    "Downscales to 1080p with reduced frame rate tiers. Best for laptops on battery.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缩小到 1080p 并生成较低帧率的版本。最适合使用电池的笔记本电脑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drawn without %@, whose shader Phosphene couldn’t translate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
