    "Starting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在开始…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam Workshop": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 创意工坊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop Making Videos": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止制作视频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subscribe on the Steam Workshop and downloads appear here. Select wallpapers, then choose Make Videos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Steam 创意工坊订阅后，下载内容会出现在这里。选择壁纸，然后选择“制作视频”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subscribe to more wallpapers on the Steam Workshop and they appear here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Steam 创意工坊订阅更多壁纸，它们就会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subscribe to wallpapers on the Steam Workshop and Phosphene makes them into video wallpapers. In Sevoflurane’s Steam, install Wallpaper Engine first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Steam 创意工坊订阅壁纸，Phosphene 就能把它们做成视频墙纸。请先在 Sevoflurane 的 Steam 里安装 Wallpaper Engine。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subscribe to wallpapers on the Steam Workshop and Phosphene makes them into video wallpapers. Wallpaper Engine runs in Windows Steam; Sevoflurane brings that Steam to your Mac, free, from the maker of Phosphene.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Steam 创意工坊订阅壁纸，Phosphene 就能把它们做成视频墙纸。Wallpaper Engine 在 Windows 版 Steam 里运行；Sevoflurane 能把这个 Steam 带到你的 Mac 上，免费，出自 Phosphene 的开发者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The author has updated this wallpaper since. Make the video again to get the changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "作者此后更新了这张壁纸。重新制作视频即可获得更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download isn’t complete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载尚未完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name of the video to set as wallpaper": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要设定为墙纸的视频名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The update couldn't be installed. Try again, or get it from the releases page.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法安装更新。请重试，或从发布页面获取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The video leaves out %@, which need Wallpaper Engine running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视频省略了 %@，这些内容需要 Wallpaper Engine 运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The videos leave your library and System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些视频会从资料库和“系统设置”中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac has no Secure Enclave, so nothing is sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 没有安全隔区，因此不会发送任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
